                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Insanely janky because of the year it was released, and a couple levels have horrid design, but other than that it's an incredibly fun game about 90% of the time. My main issues are the swimming & climbing, and the occasional time when you have to do some sort of parkour (the parkour SUCKS) but since most of the time you're sneaking around somewhere and figuring out your next plan of attack, it's quite challenging to figure out where you're going for your objective. On top of that the stealth mechanics reward slow playstyles a lot and makes you slow down instead of rushing into a your goal (which you can sometimes make work). \n\nOverall worth picking up especially with the community made fan levels & mods out there that let you get stuff like HD textures and fixes for a lot of the 90s jank this game offers.",
